<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 9.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 9.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports at Arkhangelsk and Murmansk in northern Russia face a 70 percent chance of closure on October 11 and October 12 due to strong winds, rain and low clouds, the Russian Weather Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
